BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MacMillan Coffee Morning
DTSTART:20260925T081500Z
DTEND:20260925T091500Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T153806Z
UID:stpauls-859@school-calendar-feed
DESCRIPTION:School are asking for donations of individually wrapped cakes 
 and biscuits (due to allergies) to be sent into school by Thursday 24th Se
 ptember. Use by date to be at least Friday 25th September.\n\nEvery child 
 in the school will be taking part to support this event in their classroom
 \, they will not be coming into the hall.  \n\nSchool are asking for a don
 ation to Macmillan Cancer Relief per child which will include a drink and 
 biscuits or cake\, and per adult as part of the coffee morning.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T153806Z
LOCATION:School Hall
URL:https://www.st-pauls.enfield.sch.uk/calendar/?calid=1&pid=3&viewid=1&e
 vent=859
END:VEVENT
